   - /url: /Vespa314/chan.py/blob/main/quick_guide.md\n    - text: ；\n  - paragraph: 如有使用疑惑，欢迎讨论/邮件联系。\n  - paragraph:\n    - strong: 特别说明②\n    - text: ：依赖最低版本为python3.11；由于本项目是高度计算密集型，鉴于python3.11发布且运算速度大幅提升，实测相比于python 3.8.5计算时间缩短约16%，故后续开发均基于python3.11；\n  - separator\n  - heading \"缠论框架使用文档\" [ref=e6] [level=1]\n  - 'link \"Permalink: 缠论框架使用文档\"':\n    - /url: \"#缠论框架使用文档\"\n  - list:\n    - listitem:\n      - link \"缠论框架使用文档\" [ref=e7]:\n        - /url: \"#%E7%BC%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3\"\n      - list:\n        - listitem:\n          - link \"功能介绍\" [ref=e8]:\n            - /url: \"#%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D\"\n          - list:\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"1. 缠论基本元素计算\" [ref=e9]:\n                - /url: \"#1-%E7%BC%A0%E8%AE%BA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97\"\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"2. 策略买卖点开发\" [ref=e10]:\n                - /url: \"#2-%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E4%B9%B0%E5%8D%96%E7%82%B9%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91\"\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"3. 策略对接机器学习框架\" [ref=e11]:\n                - /url: \"#3-%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%8E%A5%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6\"\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"4. 线上交易\" [ref=e12]:\n                - /url: \"#4-%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93\"\n        - listitem:\n          - link \"目录结构 & 文件说明\" [ref=e13]:\n            - /url: \"#%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84--%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E\"\n        - listitem:\n          - link \"安装方法\" [ref=e14]:\n            - /url: \"#%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95\"\n          - list:\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"配置文件介绍\" [ref=e15]:\n                - /url: \"#%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D\"\n            - listitem:\n              - link \"自行开发必要工具类\" [ref=e16]:\n                - /url: \"#%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E