{"type":"message","id":"7a55300b","parentId":"4a36cec0","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:50:27.430Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me create the project structure and start building the financial data perception layer while czsc installs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_230c0291e86d4cc8a23201b7","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 缠论元交易体系 - 配置文件\n\n## 数据源配置\ndata_sources:\n  # A股/港股/美股\n  akshare:\n    enabled: true\n    description: \"akshare - 覆盖A股/港股/美股/期货\"\n  \n  # 加密货币\n  ccxt:\n    enabled: true\n    exchange: \"binance\"\n    description: \"ccxt - 覆盖加密货币交易所\"\n  \n  # 期货（A50等）\n  sina:\n    enabled: ## 缠论Multi-Agent Trading System\n\n> Phase 3: 多Agent框架 + 金融数据感知层\n\n### 架构\n\n```\n金融数据感知层 (Data Perception Layer)\n├── A股: akshare\n├──港股/美股: akshare + futu\n├──加密货币: ccxt (binance/bybit)\n├──期货/A50: akshare futures\n└──宏观数据: akshare + web scraping\n\n缠论计算层 (CZSC Layer)\n├── Rust核心: czsc._native\n├──信号函数: 220+ built-in\n└──自定义信号: chanlun-agent/signals/\n\nMulti-Agent决策层\n├── 缠论结构分析师\n├──宏观情绪分析师\n├──多空辩论员\n├──风控评估员\n└──投资组合经理\n\n输出层\n├──飞书文档/多维表格\n├──飞书消息推送\n└──OpenClaw Heartbeat集成\n```\n\n### 快速启动\n\n```bash\ncd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent\npython3 main.py\n```\ntrue\n    description: \"新浪期货 - A50等\"\n\n## 关注品种\nwatchlist:\n  futures:\n    - symbol: \"A50\"\n      code: \"CHINA_A50\"\n      exchange: \"SGX\"\n    - symbol: \"HSI\"\n      code: \"HSI\"\n      exchange: \"HKEX\"\n  \n  crypto:\n    - symbol: \"BTC/USDT\"\n      exchange: \"binance\"\n    - symbol: \"ETH/USDT\"\n      exchange: \"binance\"\n  \n  stocks_cn:\n    - code: \"000001\"\n      name: \"平安银行\"\n    - code: \"600519\"\n      name: \"贵州茅台\"\n  \n  stocks_us:\n    - code: \"AAPL\"\n      name: \"Apple\"\n    - code: \"NVDA\"\n      name: \"NVIDIA\"\n\n## 缠论配置\nchanlun:\n  freqs: [\"日线\", \"30分钟\", \"5分钟\"]\n  bi_algo: \"normal\"\n  seg_algo: \"chan\"\n  zs_algo: \"normal\"\n  divergence_rate: 0.9\n  bs_type: \"1,2,3a,3b,2s,1p\"\n\n## 飞书配置\nfeishu:\n  app_id: \"${FEISHU_APP_ID}\"\n  app_secret: \"${FEISHU_APP_SECRET}\"\n  report_doc_token: \"\"  # 报告文档 token\n  portfolio_bitable: \"\" # 持仓多维表格 token\n\n## 扫描调度\nschedule:\n  morning_scan: \"08:00\"\n  noon_scan: \"12:00\"\n  evening_scan: \"18:00\"\n  night_scan: \"22:00\"\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/settings.yaml"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":111,"output":810,"cacheRead":110464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111385,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779108596844}}
