{"type":"message","id":"478e65a8","parentId":"dff7878c","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:53:23.726Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! VAN sent a comprehensive finance perception pack with two skills:\n\n1. **finance-perception** - Financial data perception layer with:\n   - Multi-market support (US/HK/A-shares/Forex/Crypto)\n   - Smart routing with fallback\n   - Signal scanning\n   - Data sources: iTick, Polygon.io, Binance, AKShare, FRED\n\n2. **global-info-fetcher** - Broader information gathering with:\n   - HackerNews, Lobste.rs, GitHub Trending, Reddit, RSS, arXiv, NVD/CVE\n   - Financial sources integrated: iTick, Binance, AKShare, Polygon, FRED\n   - Source health monitoring and quality metrics\n\nNow I need to integrate these into the chanlun-agent project, verify czsc is installed, and test the data sources.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"完美！金融数据感知层已经到位。让我把它集成到缠论系统中。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6a95ed04012e4ad394be28c9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import czsc; print(f'czsc version: {czsc.__version__}')\" 2>&1","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_911c1bebc5f34b7483fe1006","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":80,"path":"/tmp/finance-pack/skills/global-info-fetcher/finance_fetcher.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":7891,"output":466,"cacheRead":66368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74725,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779108794165}}
