{"type":"message","id":"2f090d45","parentId":"38283e3a","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:00:44.721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create a comprehensive summary for VAN showing what has been accomplished.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，Phase 3 推进完成！以下是成果：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已完成\n\n### 1. **CZSC 安装成功**\n- czsc v0.10.12（Rust + Python 混合架构）\n- 核心算法 Rust 实现，高性能\n\n### 2. **金融数据感知层集成**\n- FinanceFetcher v2.0 已集成\n- 支持：美股/港股/A股/外汇/加密货币/宏观经济\n- 数据源：Polygon.io, iTick, Binance, AKShare, FRED\n- 智能路由 + 自动降级\n\n### 3. **缠论数据感知集成层**\n- `chanlun_perception.py` 开发完成\n- 功能：\n  - 多市场K线数据获取\n  - CZSC 缠论结构分析（笔/中枢/趋势/背驰）\n  - 信号扫描与报告生成\n\n### 4. **CZSC 分析测试通过**\n```\n【日线】趋势: down, 笔: 19, 中枢: 6\n【30分钟】趋势: down, 笔: 25, 中枢: 7\n【5分钟】趋势: down, 笔: 28, 中枢: 8\n```\n\n### 5. **项目结构**\n```\nchanlun-agent/\n├── main.py                  # 主入口\n├── chanlun_perception.py    # 核心集成层\n├── config/settings.yaml     # 配置文件\n├── data/\n│   ├── finance_fetcher/     # 金融数据感知\n│   └── finance_perception/  # 感知技能\n└── reports/                 # 分析报告\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 待解决\n\n1. **Binance 连接被墙** — 需配置代理或使用其他加密货币数据源\n2. **API Keys 未配置** — iTick/Polygon/FRED 需要密钥才能获取实时数据\n3. **Multi-Agent 框架** — TradingAgents 集成待下一步\n\n---\n\n## 📋 下一步\n\n1. 配置 API Keys（iTick/Polygon）\n2. 配置代理访问 Binance\n3. 集成 TradingAgents 多Agent框架\n4. 飞书多维表格创建\n5. OpenClaw 心跳集成\n\n需要继续推进哪个方向？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":450,"output":572,"cacheRead":98816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99838,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779109231201}}
