{"type":"message","id":"3897678b","parentId":"f634b84c","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:39:26.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me provide a summary to VAN explaining the situation and what needs to be done.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，检查完毕。金融感知包里的 API Keys 并未嵌入，需要配置。\n\n## 📋 现状\n\n**已创建** `/workspace/projects/workspace/SECRET.md`（占位符）\n\n需要填入实际的 API Key：\n- `ITICK_API_KEY` - 美股/港股/A股/外汇（iTick 免费注册）\n- `POLYGON_API_KEY_V2` - 美股/外汇/加密（Polygon.io 免费注册）\n- `FRED_API_KEY` - 宏观经济（FRED 免费注册）\n\n## ✅ 系统行为\n\n| 状态 | 行为 |\n|------|------|\n| 有 API Keys | 获取实时数据，CZSC 分析 |\n| 无 API Keys | 自动切换 mock 数据测试 |\n\n## 🔧 获取 API Keys\n\n1. **iTick**: https://www.itick.org/ → 注册 → Dashboard 获取 Key\n2. **Polygon.io**: https://polygon.io/ → 注册 → API Keys 页面\n3. **FRED**: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html → 申请\n\n填入 `SECRET.md` 后，运行 `python3 main.py --scan` 即可获取实时数据。\n\nVAN 有现成的 API Keys 吗？还是需要我帮忙申请？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":324,"output":329,"cacheRead":116416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117069,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779111553365}}
