{"type":"message","id":"0b12be92","parentId":"fcf31839","timestamp":"2026-05-18T14:12:20.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me provide a summary to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，实盘测试成功！\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 缠论元交易系统 v1.0 - 实盘数据验证\n\n### API Keys 配置完成\n- **iTick**: ✅ 已配置（过期日 2026-05-25）\n- **Polygon.io**: ✅ V2 主用，V1 备用\n- **Binance**: ⚠️ 被墙（需代理）\n\n### 实时缠论分析结果\n\n**AAPL (苹果)**\n- 日线：下跌趋势，20笔，6中枢\n- 5分钟：下跌趋势，6笔，2中枢\n\n**NVDA (英伟达)**\n- 日线：下跌趋势，25笔，8中枢\n- 5分钟：下跌趋势，9笔，3中枢\n\n### 已知问题\n- **Binance**: 网络被墙，加密货币数据暂不可用\n- **A股**: iTick KlineInterval 映射错误，需修复\n- **Polygon 限流**: 429 Too Many Requests（免费版5次/分钟）\n\n---\n\n## 📋 下一步\n\n1. **修复 A股数据源**（iTick KlineInterval 映射）\n2. **配置代理访问 Binance**（加密货币数据）\n3. **飞书多维表格创建**（持仓/信号/报告）\n4. **OpenClaw 心跳集成**（定时扫描）\n\n继续哪个方向？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":389,"output":340,"cacheRead":105728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779113532966}}
