ty=2）\n\n## Open TODOs\n- FinanceFetcher.get_quote() 通过 ChanlunPerception 调用时仍返回 None，虽然直接通过 SmartRouter.get_fetcher() 手动激活后可正常获取数据\n- 根本原因：`get_quote` 调用链中 `router.get_fetcher()` 返回的 fetcher 未正确激活，导致 \"No available data source for US:AAPL\"\n- 缠论分析（analyze_symbol）可用但 Quote 返回 None 的问题需修复\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- iTick: 5次/分钟REST, 3个WebSocket订阅, 14400次/天, K线最多500条/次, 不含加密货币\n- Polygon.io: 5次/分钟, 15分钟延迟\n- iTick Key 过期日: 2026-05-25\n- Binance: 完全免费无需key（使用ccxt）\n\n## Pending user asks\n- VAN 提供了 API keys，期望系统能正常获取跨市场实时行情数据\n- 当前 Quote 获取通过 ChanlunPerception 仍然失败\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- **iTick API Key**: `a652cc8b608e482cadefa30cddeba1d1be5607341262439785a1d549dd0422c5`\n- **iTick Base URL**: `https://api0.itick.org`（⚠️ `api-free.itick.org` 不可用）\n- **Polygon V2 API Key**: `1jj7yCMx3Xzx7fx6o1yMZ7zLitEa0Vj7`\n- **Polygon V1 API Key**: `WN8c4cvdHRcwXb_ZU8s_Wb5elw5j_`\n- **SECRET.md 路径**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/SECRET.md`\n- **项目路径**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent`\n- **FinanceFetcher 路径**: `data/finance_fetcher/finance_fetcher.py`\n- **配置路径**: `data/finance_fetcher/sources_config.json`\n- **chanlun_perception.py**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py`\n- **SmartRouter secrets keys**: `ITICK_API_KEY`, `POLYGON_V2_KEY`, `POLYGON_V1_KEY`\n- **Polygon AAPL 测试结果**: price=300.23, high=303.2, low=296.52, open=297.9, prev_close=300.23\n- **缠论分析结果**: AAPL日线 trend=down, bi_count=19, zs_count=6\n- **关键日志**: `Registered 5 providers`（直接用FinanceFetcher）vs `Registered 3 providers`（通过ChanlunPerception）\n- **SmartRouter 关键方法**: `_activate_provider()`, `get_fetcher()`, `route_with_fallback()`, `report_success()`, `report_failure()`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Pre-compaction memory flush. Store durable memories only in memory/2026-05-18.md (create memory/ if needed). Treat workspace bootstrap/reference files such as MEMORY.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, and AGENTS.md as read-only during this flush; never overwrite, repl