{"type":"message","id":"b70a02f8","parentId":"166c6fda","timestamp":"2026-05-18T14:54:02.834Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no 22:00 signal file for today. The 22:00 scan hasn't been done yet. According to HEARTBEAT.md, I need to:\n\n1. 夜盘扫描: 收盘数据,每日报告\n2. 生成每日综合报告\n\nLet me execute the 22:00 scan. I should run the chanlun analysis on the key symbols and generate a comprehensive daily report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"22:00 夜盘扫描未执行。执行每日综合扫描："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3d7926fcdd9f461e8717f7d4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && timeout 180 python3 -c \"\nfrom chanlun_perception import ChanlunPerception\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nperception = ChanlunPerception()\n\n# 关注品种列表\nsymbols = [\n    ('AAPL', 'US', '苹果'),\n    ('NVDA', 'US', '英伟达'),\n    ('CRCL', 'US', 'Circle'),\n]\n\nresults = []\nfor symbol, market, name in symbols:\n    print(f'扫描 {name}...')\n    quote = perception.get_quote(symbol, market)\n    structures = perception.analyze_symbol(symbol, market, ['日线'])\n    \n    daily = structures.get('日线')\n    if daily:\n        results.append({\n            'symbol': symbol,\n            'name': name,\n            'price': quote.get('price', 0) if quote else 0,\n            'trend': daily.trend,\n            'bi_count': daily.bi_count,\n            'zs_count': daily.zs_count,\n            'zs_range': daily.last_zs_range,\n            'last_bi': daily.last_bi_direction,\n            'divergence': daily.divergence\n        })\n\n# 输出 JSON\nprint(json.dumps(results, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"WARNING\\|INFO\"","timeout":200,"yieldMs":190000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":304,"output":536,"cacheRead":69568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70408,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779116035295}}
