{"type":"message","id":"f58aefd2","parentId":"2f3b7e73","timestamp":"2026-05-18T16:30:30.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've set up a cron job to run at 1:00 AM. Now let me also prepare a summary for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **已设置 1:00 AM 准时报价任务**\n\n```\n任务: CRCL 1:00 AM 准时报价\n时间: 2026-05-19 01:00:00 (约31分钟后)\n内容:\n- Polygon 报价\n- iTick 报价\n- 对比差异\n- 确认是否实时\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 当前数据对比\n\n| 数据源 | 价格 | 时间戳 | 延迟 |\n|--------|------|--------|------|\n| Polygon | $114.00 | 收盘价 | 无实时 |\n| iTick | $109.07 | 00:12 | ~15分钟 |\n\n**你的报价**: $108.93（可能更接近实时）\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 预期结果\n\n1:00 AM 测试将确认：\n- 各数据源是否更新\n- 价格差异是否收敛\n- 哪个数据源更可靠\n\n---\n\nVAN，1:00 AM 会自动运行并通知你结果。要我现在先手动测试一次吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":658,"output":319,"cacheRead":92864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93841,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779121819093}}
