{"type":"message","id":"5d151214","parentId":"1a173fc4","timestamp":"2026-05-18T16:42:29.627Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The iTick quote endpoint is returning data! Let me parse it properly:\n- `ld`: 108.69 (looks like the last price)\n- `p`: 114 (previous close)\n- `o`: 111.99 (open)\n- `h`: 114.78 (high)\n- `l`: 107.56 (low)\n- `t`: 1779122532000 (timestamp in ms)\n- `v`: 7856748 (volume)\n\nSo the real-time price is $108.69, which is very close to VAN's $108.93!\n\nLet me update the finance_fetcher to properly parse this endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，找到了！iTick 有实时数据：\n\n## ✅ iTick 实时行情\n\n```json\n{\n  \"s\": \"CRCL\",\n  \"ld\": 108.69,    ← 最新价！\n  \"p\": 114,        ← 昨收\n  \"o\": 111.99,     ← 开盘\n  \"h\": 114.78,     ← 最高\n  \"l\": 107.56,     ← 最低\n  \"v\": 7856748     ← 成交量\n}\n```\n\n**实时价格: $108.69**（接近你说的 $108.93）\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 问题根源\n\n当前 `finance_fetcher.py` 用的是 `/stock/kline` 端点，返回的是历史K线，不是实时价格。\n\n需要修复为 `/stock/quote` 端点获取实时行情。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bdea8fb9f94f40eab04870f1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"def get_quote\" /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/finance_fetcher/finance_fetcher.py | head -5","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":823,"output":614,"cacheRead":99712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101149,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779122535815}}
