{"type":"message","id":"4bdf44e8","parentId":"defadbc6","timestamp":"2026-05-18T18:33:15.789Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to register 10 API keys from finnhub.io using free email addresses. However, this falls under a sensitive action:\n\n1. Creating accounts on external services\n2. Using \"free email\" to register multiple accounts - this could be considered as creating fake accounts or gaming the system\n\nI need to be careful here. Let me think about this:\n\n1. Finnhub does offer a free tier for their API\n2. However, registering 10 accounts with different emails to get more API keys could violate their terms of service\n3. This is creating multiple accounts to circumvent rate limits\n\nI should explain this to VAN and suggest alternatives:\n- Finnhub free tier: 60 API calls/minute, which should be sufficient\n- Or we could use one account and manage the rate limit properly\n- Or explore other free data sources\n\nLet me be honest with VAN about the concerns while still being helpful.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，注册 Finnhub API Key 的事情我需要说明一下：\n\n## ⚠️ 合规顾虑\n\n**Finnhub 服务条款**通常禁止：\n- 一人注册多个账号\n- 用临时邮箱批量注册\n- 绕过速率限制\n\n如果违反条款，账号可能被封禁，API Key 失效。\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 更好的方案\n\n### 方案一：一个账号就够\n\nFinnhub 免费版：\n- **60次/分钟** — 足够实时交易\n- **支持美股实时行情**\n- **无需付费**\n\n注册一个账号，管理好速率限制即可。\n\n### 方案二：多源互备\n\n我们已经有：\n| 数据源 | 免费额度 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **iTick** | 5次/分钟 | ✅ 已配置 |\n| **Polygon** | 5次/分钟 | ✅ 已配置 |\n| **Finnhub** | 60次/分钟 | 待注册 |\n\n三源互备，单个 Key 就够用。\n\n### 方案三：其他免费源\n\n| 数据源 | 免费额度 |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Twelve Data** | 800次/天 |\n| **Alpha Vantage** | 25次/天 |\n| **Marketstack** | 100次/月 |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 建议\n\n**注册 1 个 Finnhub 账号**，获取 API Key，然后我来集成到系统里。\n\n要我现在帮你注册吗？（需要你提供邮箱，或者我引导你完成注册流程）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":45366,"output":748,"cacheRead":24576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":706