{"type":"message","id":"2b2f2bc7","parentId":"c7a8582b","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:07:12.017Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking me to go directly to register on Finnhub. He wants me to do the registration process using the browser. Let me help him with this.\n\nActually, wait - he said \"不用直接去注册\" which means \"don't directly go register\" - he's saying don't bother with the registration process right now.\n\nOr maybe he's saying \"不用，直接去注册\" - \"No need, just go directly to register\" - meaning skip the testing and just go register the Finnhub key.\n\nActually in Chinese context, \"不用直接去注册\" could mean:\n1. \"不用直接去注册\" = \"Don't go register directly\" (don't bother)\n2. Or it could be a typo/short form\n\nGiven the context (VAN wants Finnhub keys for the trading system), I think he's saying \"Never mind, just go ahead and register\" - meaning he wants me to proceed with registration.\n\nLet me navigate to finnhub.io/register and help with the registration process.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，直接去注册。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e8c7e86c43b64d709fc5b77a","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"open","profile":"user","url":"https://finnhub.io/register"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1030,"output":474,"cacheRead":71424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72928,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779131223331}}
